    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17409" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔλειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, sts. also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span> (cf. infr.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the
				court,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ αὐλείῃσι θύρῃσι</span> at the
			door <i>of the court,</i> i.e. the <i>outer</i> door,
			<i>house</i>-door, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.239
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				1.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.69
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔλειοι θύραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sol.
					4.28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ προθύροις . . οὐδοῦ ἐπ᾽ αὐλείου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.104
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτὸς αὐ. πυλῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς αὐλείοισιν ἑστηκὼς πύλαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					438
				</span></i>
			: sg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ αὔλειος θύρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					1.17
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				212c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				28.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				546
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ αὐλεία θύρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					11(2).287
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				146
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				18.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ αὐλεία</span> alone, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				982
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				255
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				2587.122
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ αὔλειος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					46
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				2.516f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tox.</u>
				17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ αὔλειοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.76.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
